OL,3,AUkraine and Russia trade strikes on key
OL,4,Abridges
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussia and Ukraine traded attacks on
OL,7,Fkey bridges overnight, with reports of
OL,8,Fsignificant damage to a symbolic bridge
OL,9,Flinking occupied Crimea and Russia.
OL,11,FA former adviser to Ukrainian President
OL,12,FVolodymyr Zelensky shared images
OL,13,Fpurporting to show that a section of
OL,14,Fthe Crimea bridge - also known as the
OL,15,FKerch Bridge - had collapsed into the
OL,16,Fwater.
OL,18,FMeanwhile, Kyiv Mayor Vitali Klitschko
OL,19,Fsaid the Northern and Southern bridges,
OL,20,Fimportant routes over the Dnipro River,
OL,21,Fwere closed after Russian ballistic
OL,22,Fmissile strikes.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
