OL,3,AUkraine and Russia trade strikes on key
OL,4,Abridges
OL,5,
OL,6,FThose attacks came a day after Ukraine
OL,7,Fbegan its most recent attempt to
OL,8,Fdisable the Crimea bridge, a prized
OL,9,FKremlin asset which has been seen as a
OL,10,Fsymbol of Russia's occupation of the
OL,11,Fpeninsula.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
